        -1100,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 720,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## get_business_info (new)\n`POST /webhook/get-business-info`\n\n**Body:** `business_id`\n\nThe first tool call on every call (see config/vapi-system-prompt.md). Loads this business's approved, public-facing facts -- name, industry, languages, hours, address/directions, a light service list, approved FAQs, whether booking is enabled, and restricted topics. Everything returned here is scoped to the resolved business_id; no cross-business data is ever included."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad360120-618a-46d0-b49b-3d44c5c910b5",
